---@field queryInsightsConfig? gcp.alloydb_v1.QueryInsightsInstanceConfig Configuration for query insights.
---@field readPoolConfig? gcp.alloydb_v1.ReadPoolConfig Read pool instance configuration. This is required if the value of instanceType is READ_POOL.
---@field clientConnectionConfig? gcp.alloydb_v1.ClientConnectionConfig Optional. Client connection specific configurations
---@field outboundPublicIpAddresses? gcp.alloydb_v1.StringList Output only. All outbound public IP addresses configured for the instance.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Update time stamp
---@field reconciling? boolean Output only. Reconciling (https://google.aip.dev/128#reconciliation). Set to true if the current state of Instance does not match the user's intended state, and the service is actively updating the resource to reconcile them. This can happen due to user-triggered updates or system actions like failover or maintenance.
